      "value": "One vertical reading sequence: heading, summary, revision, review count, cards 01–06, review action, cards 07–10, and end note. Cards have distinct neutral surfaces and vertical gaps. No horizontal clipping, overlap, missing cards, or accidental reordering. Required full-content evidence must reach the real bottom with overlap.",
